Q: Cannot find class [org.springframework.mail.javamail.JavaMailSenderImpl] for bean with name 'mailSender' defined
A: <p>At some point org.springframework.mail.javamail.JavaMailSenderImpl was moved to the dependency spring-context-support. </p>

<p>Ensure that you have: the artifact spring-context-support
included in your project 
