<p>The <code>addListener</code> function accepts three parameters:</p>

<ul>
<li>The item on which to attach the event (the marker in this case)</li>
<li>The type of event to listen for</li>
<li>The lamba or function to execute when the event occurs (opening an infoWindow)</li>
