}
</code></pre>

<p>Be sure that you <strong>don't</strong> do the following:</p>

<pre><code>if (element.mouseover()) {
    // Supports the mouseover event
}
</code></pre>

<p>The latter would actually call the method, rather than check for its existence.</p>

