Q: collection not return values in `meteorJs`?
A: <p>Here's how you can publish and subscribe to a collection without the autopublish package (highly recommended as it has security and performance benefits)</p>

<p><strong>Server Publication</strong></p>

<pre><code>if (Meteor.isServer) {
    // publish entire hcare_users collection
